'''Titan Cat''' is the 9th [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cat]] unlocked. It is available after clearing [[Italy (Empire of Cats)|Italy]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 for 8,000 XP or via the [[Cat Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] doubles health and damage and gains a 30% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] all non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies but has an increased recharge time.

